	(descr "Aptiv SICMA 24-way hybrid sealed header, right angle, HCCPHPE24BKA90F. 3 rows x 8. Columns 1 and 8 (A1-C1, A8-C8) = 2.8 mm terminals, columns 2-7 = 1.5 mm. Geometry per FCI/Aptiv drawing FSC 308654 (black key): holes 1.3+0.2, pitch 4.15/3.33, rows 4.2, peg slots 2.2x3.5 / 2.2x5.0, PCB edge 7.5 mm from row C, edge notch 2.0x2.2 at 16.0 from pattern centre. Mating side toward +Y.")
